# `onPermanent` on a permanent and `onInstantOrSorcery` on an instant or sorcery spell: a keyword
# the rules define differently for each, read from the object's current Permanent Types
# [CR#110.4,110.4a].
# [CR#110.4,110.4a]
primitive byCardClass(onPermanent: Ability, onInstantOrSorcery: Ability): Ability
